{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-45286","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52611","text":"κ Integration Spec: Product-Level Specification"}]},{"id":"blk-45287","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52612","text":"Version 0.2.0 — Normalized"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45289","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52613","text":"How the cyclicity invariant κ is computed, surfaced, and used across Graphonomous, BendScript, Deliberatic, TickTickClock, and the [&] Protocol.  "},{"id":"spn-52614","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.2.0 changes (from Codex review):"},{"id":"spn-52615","text":" - Normalized all field names to a single canonical schema (§2.4) - Resolved tool naming: "},{"id":"spn-52616","marks":["code"],"text":"analyze_topology"},{"id":"spn-52617","text":" is the standalone tool; "},{"id":"spn-52618","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"},{"id":"spn-52619","text":" gains a "},{"id":"spn-52620","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-52621","text":" field — no "},{"id":"spn-52622","marks":["code"],"text":"memory_recall_with_topology"},{"id":"spn-52623","text":" tool - Fixed approximation representation: "},{"id":"spn-52624","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-52625","text":" is always an integer; large SCCs add "},{"id":"spn-52626","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-52627","text":" (no "},{"id":"spn-52628","marks":["code"],"text":"exact"},{"id":"spn-52629","text":" field) - Added instrumentation requirements (§7) - Clarified BendScript directed-edge policy (§4.3)"}]}],"id":"blk-45288","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-45290","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52630","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45291","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52631","text":"1. Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-45292","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52632","text":"κ (kappa) is a graph-theoretic invariant that measures the minimum irreducible bidirectional information flow in a directed graph. It is the routing primitive that determines whether a query region of a knowledge graph requires single-pass retrieval (κ = 0) or iterative deliberation (κ > 0)."}]},{"id":"blk-45293","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52633","text":"This spec defines:"}]},{"id":"blk-45294","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45296","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52634","text":"How κ is computed"}]}],"id":"blk-45295","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45298","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52635","text":"Where it is computed in the stack"}]}],"id":"blk-45297","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45300","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52636","text":"How it routes inference"}]}],"id":"blk-45299","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45302","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52637","text":"How it is surfaced to users"}]}],"id":"blk-45301","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45304","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52638","text":"How it integrates with each product"}]}],"id":"blk-45303","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45305","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52639","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45306","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52640","text":"2. Computation"}]},{"id":"blk-45307","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52641","text":"2.1 Algorithm"}]},{"id":"blk-45308","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function compute_kappa(graph):\n    # Pre-step: define node universe U from the analyzed subgraph/query result.\n    # Ignore any edge where src ∉ U or dst ∉ U.\n    # Exclude self-loops (u -> u) from adjacency for κ computation.\n    # Step 1: Find all strongly connected components\n    sccs = tarjan_scc(graph)                    # O(V + E)\n\n    # Step 2: For each nontrivial SCC (size > 1)\n    results = []\n    for scc in sccs where |scc| > 1:\n        # Step 3: Enumerate bipartitions, find minimum bidirectional cut\n        k = infinity\n        for (A, B) in nontrivial_bipartitions(scc):\n            edges_a_to_b = count_edges(A, B, graph)\n            edges_b_to_a = count_edges(B, A, graph)\n            bidirectional_cut = min(edges_a_to_b, edges_b_to_a)\n            k = min(k, bidirectional_cut)\n            if k == 0: break  # early exit (can't go lower)\n\n        # Step 4: Record SCC with its κ value and minimum-cut partition\n        results.append({\n            scc: scc,\n            kappa: k,\n            min_cut_partition: (A_min, B_min),\n            min_cut_edges: edges_achieving_minimum\n        })\n\n    return results"},{"id":"blk-45309","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52642","text":"2.2 Complexity"}]},{"id":"blk-45310","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45312","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52643","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCC decomposition:"},{"id":"spn-52644","text":" O(V + E) via Tarjan's algorithm"}]}],"id":"blk-45311","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52645","marks":["bold"],"text":"κ computation per SCC:"},{"id":"spn-52646","text":" O(2^|SCC| × |SCC|²) in the worst case (enumerating all bipartitions)"}]}],"id":"blk-45313","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45316","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52647","marks":["bold"],"text":"Practical constraint:"},{"id":"spn-52648","text":" For SCCs up to ~20 nodes, bipartition enumeration is feasible in real time. For larger SCCs, use approximation:"}]}],"id":"blk-45315","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45318","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52649","text":"Return SCC size as a proxy for κ, with "},{"id":"spn-52650","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-52651","text":" flag"}]}],"id":"blk-45317","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45320","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52652","text":"κ field remains an integer (the estimate), never a symbol/atom/string"}]}],"id":"blk-45319","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45322","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52653","marks":["bold"],"text":"Node-universe rule (NORMATIVE):"},{"id":"spn-52654","text":" Analyze only the node set supplied by retrieval/query scope (or explicit "},{"id":"spn-52655","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-52656","text":" input). Do not pull in external nodes implicitly during κ analysis."}]}],"id":"blk-45321","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52657","marks":["bold"],"text":"Self-loop rule (NORMATIVE):"},{"id":"spn-52658","text":" Exclude self-loops ("},{"id":"spn-52659","marks":["code"],"text":"source == target"},{"id":"spn-52660","text":") from κ adjacency and cut counts."}]}],"id":"blk-45323","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45325","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52661","text":"2.3 Incremental Updates"}]},{"id":"blk-45326","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52662","text":"When an edge is added or removed from the knowledge graph:"}]},{"id":"blk-45327","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52663","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-52664","marks":["bold"],"text":"Edge addition:"},{"id":"spn-52665","text":" Can only merge SCCs or enlarge existing ones. Re-run Tarjan on the affected component. If a new nontrivial SCC is formed, compute κ for it. 2. "},{"id":"spn-52666","marks":["bold"],"text":"Edge removal:"},{"id":"spn-52667","text":" Can only split SCCs or shrink them. Re-run Tarjan on the affected component. Recompute κ for any remaining nontrivial SCCs. 3. "},{"id":"spn-52668","marks":["bold"],"text":"Optimization:"},{"id":"spn-52669","text":" Maintain an SCC index alongside the knowledge graph. Incremental SCC algorithms (e.g., Bender, Fineman & Gilbert 2015) can update SCCs in O(V) amortized per edge change."}]},{"id":"blk-45328","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52670","text":"2.4 Canonical Schema (NORMATIVE — all implementations must match)"}]},{"id":"blk-45329","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52671","text":"Every κ topology result — whether from Elixir, JavaScript, or MCP JSON — uses these exact field names:"}]},{"id":"blk-45330","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"sccs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scc-0\",\n      \"nodes\": [\"node-a\", \"node-b\"],\n      \"kappa\": 2,\n      \"approximate\": false,\n      \"fault_line_edges\": [\n        {\"source\": \"node-a\", \"target\": \"node-b\"}\n      ],\n      \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n      \"deliberation_budget\": {\n        \"max_iterations\": 3,\n        \"agent_count\": 2,\n        \"timeout_multiplier\": 2.0,\n        \"confidence_threshold\": 0.80\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dag_nodes\": [\"node-x\", \"node-y\"],\n  \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n  \"max_kappa\": 2,\n  \"scc_count\": 1\n}"},{"id":"blk-45331","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52672","marks":["bold"],"text":"Field name rules (resolves all drift):"}]},{"id":"blk-45332","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45334","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52673","text":"Top-level routing key: "},{"id":"spn-52674","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-52675","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-52676","marks":["code"],"text":"overall_routing"},{"id":"spn-52677","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-45333","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45336","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52678","text":"Edge endpoints: "},{"id":"spn-52679","marks":["code"],"text":"source"},{"id":"spn-52680","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-52681","marks":["code"],"text":"target"},{"id":"spn-52682","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-52683","marks":["code"],"text":"from"},{"id":"spn-52684","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-52685","marks":["code"],"text":"to"},{"id":"spn-52686","text":", not "},{"id":"spn-52687","marks":["code"],"text":"a"},{"id":"spn-52688","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-52689","marks":["code"],"text":"b"},{"id":"spn-52690","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-45335","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45338","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52691","text":"Fault lines: "},{"id":"spn-52692","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-52693","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-52694","marks":["code"],"text":"min_cut_edges"},{"id":"spn-52695","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-45337","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45340","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52696","text":"κ type: always "},{"id":"spn-52697","marks":["code"],"text":"integer"},{"id":"spn-52698","text":" (never string, atom, or symbol)"}]}],"id":"blk-45339","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45342","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52699","text":"Approximation: "},{"id":"spn-52700","marks":["code"],"text":"\"approximate\": true"},{"id":"spn-52701","text":" boolean flag on the SCC object; "},{"id":"spn-52702","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-52703","text":" still holds the integer estimate"}]}],"id":"blk-45341","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45344","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52704","text":"Routing values: "},{"id":"spn-52705","marks":["code"],"text":"\"fast\""},{"id":"spn-52706","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-52707","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-52708","text":" (strings in JSON, atoms "},{"id":"spn-52709","marks":["code"],"text":":fast"},{"id":"spn-52710","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-52711","marks":["code"],"text":":deliberate"},{"id":"spn-52712","text":" in Elixir, strings in JS)"}]}],"id":"blk-45343","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45345","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52713","marks":["bold"],"text":"Schema boundary rules (NORMATIVE):"}]},{"id":"blk-45346","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45348","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52714","marks":["bold"],"text":"On MCP/JSON boundaries:"},{"id":"spn-52715","text":" use canonical snake_case keys exactly as defined in §2.4 ("},{"id":"spn-52716","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-52717","text":", "},{"id":"spn-52718","marks":["code"],"text":"max_kappa"},{"id":"spn-52719","text":", "},{"id":"spn-52720","marks":["code"],"text":"scc_count"},{"id":"spn-52721","text":", etc.)."}]}],"id":"blk-45347","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45350","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52722","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inside Elixir runtime:"},{"id":"spn-52723","text":" atoms are allowed for routing values ("},{"id":"spn-52724","marks":["code"],"text":":fast"},{"id":"spn-52725","text":", "},{"id":"spn-52726","marks":["code"],"text":":deliberate"},{"id":"spn-52727","text":"), but keys remain canonical and are serialized to JSON strings at the boundary."}]}],"id":"blk-45349","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45352","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52728","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inside JavaScript UI code:"},{"id":"spn-52729","text":" camelCase mirrors are allowed for local-only objects ("},{"id":"spn-52730","marks":["code"],"text":"faultLineEdges"},{"id":"spn-52731","text":", "},{"id":"spn-52732","marks":["code"],"text":"maxKappa"},{"id":"spn-52733","text":", "},{"id":"spn-52734","marks":["code"],"text":"sccCount"},{"id":"spn-52735","text":") for ergonomics, but any network payload or persisted topology record must be converted back to canonical snake_case."}]}],"id":"blk-45351","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52736","marks":["bold"],"text":"Elixir atom mapping:"}]},{"id":"blk-45354","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":"# Elixir uses atoms internally, converts to strings for MCP JSON\n:fast       → \"fast\"\n:deliberate → \"deliberate\""},{"id":"blk-45355","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52737","marks":["bold"],"text":"JavaScript mapping (local only):"}]},{"id":"blk-45356","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"// Local object ergonomics\n{ faultLineEdges, maxKappa, sccCount, routing }\n\n// MCP / wire payloads must remain canonical snake_case\n{ fault_line_edges, max_kappa, scc_count, routing }"},{"id":"blk-45357","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52738","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45358","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52739","text":"3. Routing Logic"}]},{"id":"blk-45359","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52740","text":"3.1 The κ Router"}]},{"id":"blk-45360","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52741","text":"The κ router sits between memory retrieval and reasoning. It inspects the topological structure of the retrieved subgraph and makes a routing decision."}]},{"id":"blk-45361","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function kappa_route(retrieved_subgraph):\n    scc_analysis = compute_kappa(retrieved_subgraph)\n\n    dag_context = nodes NOT in any nontrivial SCC\n    scc_contexts = scc_analysis  # list of {scc, kappa, fault_line_edges, ...}\n\n    # DAG regions: single-pass retrieval\n    retrieval_context = topological_sort_and_collect(dag_context)\n\n    # SCC regions: flag for deliberation\n    deliberation_tasks = []\n    for scc_info in scc_contexts:\n        deliberation_tasks.append({\n            nodes: scc_info.scc,\n            kappa: scc_info.kappa,\n            fault_lines: scc_info.fault_line_edges,\n            budget: deliberation_budget(scc_info.kappa)\n        })\n\n    return {\n        retrieval_context: retrieval_context,\n        deliberation_tasks: deliberation_tasks,\n        routing: \"fast\" if len(deliberation_tasks) == 0 else \"deliberate\"\n    }"},{"id":"blk-45362","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52742","text":"3.2 Deliberation Budget Function"}]},{"id":"blk-45363","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52743","text":"The deliberation budget maps κ to concrete inference parameters. This is an engineering heuristic (not proved — to be tuned empirically). Caps on "},{"id":"spn-52744","marks":["code"],"text":"max_iterations"},{"id":"spn-52745","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-52746","marks":["code"],"text":"confidence_threshold"},{"id":"spn-52747","text":" are required to prevent runaway values when "},{"id":"spn-52748","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-52749","text":" SCCs use size-based κ estimates:"}]},{"id":"blk-45364","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function deliberation_budget(kappa):\n    return {\n        max_iterations: min(kappa + 1, 4),\n        agent_count: min(kappa, 3),\n        timeout_multiplier: min(1.0 + 0.5*kappa, 3.5),\n        confidence_threshold: min(0.7 + 0.05*kappa, 0.95)\n    }"},{"id":"blk-45365","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52750","text":"3.3 The Fast Path vs. Deliberation Path"}]},{"id":"blk-45366","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  Query arrives   │\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n                      ▼\n             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  &memory.recall  │   Graphonomous retrieves relevant subgraph\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n                      ▼\n             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  κ Router        │   Compute SCCs, κ values\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n              ┌───────┴────────┐\n              │                │\n         κ = 0 (all DAG)    κ > 0 (has SCCs)\n              │                │\n              ▼                ▼\n       ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────────┐\n       │ Fast Path │    │  Deliberation │\n       │ single    │    │  &reason via  │\n       │ pass      │    │  Deliberatic  │\n       │ retrieval │    │  κ-informed   │\n       └─────┬────┘    │  budget       │\n             │         └──────┬───────┘\n             │                │\n             └───────┬────────┘\n                     │\n                     ▼\n             ┌──────────────┐\n             │  &memory.learn │   Results feed back into graph\n             └──────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-45367","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52751","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45368","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52752","text":"4. Product Integration"}]},{"id":"blk-45369","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52753","text":"4.1 Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-45370","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52754","marks":["bold"],"text":"Where κ lives:"},{"id":"spn-52755","text":" Computed at query time on the retrieved subgraph. Cached per SCC in the knowledge graph index; invalidated on edge changes."}]},{"id":"blk-45371","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52756","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-45372","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52757","marks":["code"],"text":"Retriever.retrieve/2"},{"id":"spn-52758","text":" now returns a "},{"id":"spn-52759","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-52760","text":" key alongside existing "},{"id":"spn-52761","marks":["code"],"text":"results"},{"id":"spn-52762","text":", "},{"id":"spn-52763","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-52764","text":", "},{"id":"spn-52765","marks":["code"],"text":"stats"}]}],"id":"blk-45373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52766","text":"New module "},{"id":"spn-52767","marks":["code"],"text":"Graphonomous.Topology"},{"id":"spn-52768","text":" computes and returns the full SCC analysis for a given subgraph"}]}],"id":"blk-45375","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52769","text":"New function "},{"id":"spn-52770","marks":["code"],"text":"Store.list_edges_between/1"},{"id":"spn-52771","text":" fetches edges within a node set"}]}],"id":"blk-45377","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45379","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52772","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool: `analyze_topology` (NEW standalone tool):"}]},{"id":"blk-45380","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"analyze_topology\",\n  \"description\": \"Compute topological structure (SCCs, κ values, routing decision) for a set of nodes in the knowledge graph.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"node_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"description\": \"Node IDs to analyze. If omitted, analyzes the full graph.\"\n      },\n      \"query\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Optional query text. If provided, retrieves relevant nodes first, then analyzes their topology.\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-45381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52773","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool: `retrieve_context` (EXISTING — augmented with topology):"}]},{"id":"blk-45382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52774","text":"The existing "},{"id":"spn-52775","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"},{"id":"spn-52776","text":" tool gains a "},{"id":"spn-52777","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-52778","text":" field in its response. No new tool name — same endpoint, richer response:"}]},{"id":"blk-45383","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"query\": \"company strategy\",\n  \"count\": 7,\n  \"results\": [\"...existing results...\"],\n  \"causal_context\": [\"...existing...\"],\n  \"stats\": {\"...existing...\"},\n  \"topology\": {\n    \"sccs\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"scc-0\",\n        \"nodes\": [\"market-share\", \"revenue\", \"r-and-d\", \"product-quality\", \"customer-retention\"],\n        \"kappa\": 1,\n        \"approximate\": false,\n        \"fault_line_edges\": [\n          {\"source\": \"product-quality\", \"target\": \"market-share\"}\n        ],\n        \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n        \"deliberation_budget\": {\n          \"max_iterations\": 2,\n          \"agent_count\": 1,\n          \"timeout_multiplier\": 1.5,\n          \"confidence_threshold\": 0.75\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"dag_nodes\": [\"founding-date\", \"ceo-name\", \"headquarters\"],\n    \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n    \"max_kappa\": 1,\n    \"scc_count\": 1\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-45384","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52779","text":"4.2 Deliberatic"}]},{"id":"blk-45385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52780","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-45386","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45388","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52781","text":"Accepts "},{"id":"spn-52782","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-52783","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-52784","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-52785","text":" as input parameters on its deliberation endpoint."}]}],"id":"blk-45387","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52786","text":"Uses "},{"id":"spn-52787","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-52788","text":" to set argumentation depth (number of rounds)."}]}],"id":"blk-45389","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52789","text":"Uses "},{"id":"spn-52790","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-52791","text":" (minimum-cut edges) to generate the initial propositions that agents must argue about — these are the critical bidirectional dependencies."}]}],"id":"blk-45391","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45393","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52792","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool additions:"}]},{"id":"blk-45394","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"deliberate_on_scc\",\n  \"description\": \"Run structured argumentation on a strongly connected knowledge cluster. Uses κ to set deliberation budget and fault lines to seed propositions.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"scc_nodes\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } },\n      \"scc_edges\": { \"type\": \"array\" },\n      \"kappa\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n      \"fault_line_edges\": { \"type\": \"array\" },\n      \"governance\": { \"type\": \"object\" }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-45395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52793","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key insight:"},{"id":"spn-52794","text":" Deliberatic doesn't need to know about graph theory. It receives a set of propositions (derived from fault lines), a budget (derived from κ), and it argues. The graph intelligence lives in Graphonomous; the argumentation intelligence lives in Deliberatic. κ is the handshake between them."}]},{"id":"blk-45396","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52795","text":"4.3 BendScript"}]},{"id":"blk-45397","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52796","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-45398","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52797","text":"Directed-Edge Policy (NORMATIVE)"}]},{"id":"blk-45399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52798","text":"BendScript edges have a "},{"id":"spn-52799","marks":["code"],"text":"kind"},{"id":"spn-52800","text":" property. For κ computation, edge directionality is determined by kind:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-45401","spans":[{"id":"spn-52801","text":"Edge kind"}]},{"id":"blk-45402","spans":[{"id":"spn-52802","text":"Directionality for κ"}]},{"id":"blk-45403","spans":[{"id":"spn-52803","text":"Rationale"}]}],"id":"blk-45400","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-45404","spans":[{"id":"spn-52804","marks":["code"],"text":"causal"}]},{"id":"blk-45405","spans":[{"id":"spn-52805","marks":["bold"],"text":"Directed"},{"id":"spn-52806","text":" (a → b)"}]},{"id":"blk-45406","spans":[{"id":"spn-52807","text":"Cause precedes effect"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45407","spans":[{"id":"spn-52808","marks":["code"],"text":"temporal"}]},{"id":"blk-45408","spans":[{"id":"spn-52809","marks":["bold"],"text":"Directed"},{"id":"spn-52810","text":" (a → b)"}]},{"id":"blk-45409","spans":[{"id":"spn-52811","text":"Before precedes after"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45410","spans":[{"id":"spn-52812","marks":["code"],"text":"context"}]},{"id":"blk-45411","spans":[{"id":"spn-52813","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-52814","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-45412","spans":[{"id":"spn-52815","text":"Symmetric, no feedback"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45413","spans":[{"id":"spn-52816","marks":["code"],"text":"associative"}]},{"id":"blk-45414","spans":[{"id":"spn-52817","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-52818","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-45415","spans":[{"id":"spn-52819","text":"Symmetric, no feedback"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45416","spans":[{"id":"spn-52820","marks":["code"],"text":"user"}]},{"id":"blk-45417","spans":[{"id":"spn-52821","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-52822","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-45418","spans":[{"id":"spn-52823","text":"Ambiguous directionality"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-45419","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52824","text":"This is a "},{"id":"spn-52825","marks":["bold"],"text":"hard rule"},{"id":"spn-52826","text":", not a toggle. Only "},{"id":"spn-52827","marks":["code"],"text":"causal"},{"id":"spn-52828","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-52829","marks":["code"],"text":"temporal"},{"id":"spn-52830","text":" edges participate in SCC/κ computation. The filter constant:"}]},{"id":"blk-45420","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"const DIRECTED_KINDS = ['causal', 'temporal'];"},{"id":"blk-45421","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52831","text":"Visual Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-45422","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52832","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCC clusters rendered visually:"},{"id":"spn-52833","text":" Nodes within a nontrivial SCC share a colored halo or background region. Color intensity scales with κ."}]}],"id":"blk-45423","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45426","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52834","marks":["bold"],"text":"Minimum-cut edges highlighted:"},{"id":"spn-52835","text":" Fault-line edges rendered in dashed style ("},{"id":"spn-52836","marks":["code"],"text":"ctx.setLineDash([6, 4])"},{"id":"spn-52837","text":") with brighter color."}]}],"id":"blk-45425","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52838","marks":["bold"],"text":"κ badge on SCC clusters:"},{"id":"spn-52839","text":" Each SCC cluster shows its κ value as a small badge, e.g., \"κ=2\"."}]}],"id":"blk-45427","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45429","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52840","text":"Interaction Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-45430","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45432","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52841","marks":["bold"],"text":"Topology preview via context menu:"},{"id":"spn-52842","text":" When the user right-clicks a node and selects \"Connect to…\" (a new context menu item), BendScript shows candidate target nodes with topology impact annotations:"}]}],"id":"blk-45431","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45434","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52843","text":"\"→ NodeX: creates feedback loop (κ: 0→1)\""}]}],"id":"blk-45433","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45436","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52844","text":"\"→ NodeY: strengthens loop (κ: 1→2)\""}]}],"id":"blk-45435","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52845","text":"\"→ NodeZ: no topological change\""}]}],"id":"blk-45437","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52846","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Bend\" action:"},{"id":"spn-52847","text":" Right-click context menu on DAG nodes — automatically suggests the nearest edge that would create a feedback loop."}]}],"id":"blk-45439","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52848","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Unbend\" action:"},{"id":"spn-52849","text":" Right-click context menu on SCC nodes — identifies the fault-line edge and offers to remove it."}]}],"id":"blk-45441","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52850","marks":["bold"],"text":"Note:"},{"id":"spn-52851","text":" BendScript does NOT currently have drag-to-connect edge creation. The topology preview is accessed via the context menu \"Connect to…\" flow. Do not implement drag-to-connect in this phase."}]},{"id":"blk-45444","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52852","text":"HUD"}]},{"id":"blk-45445","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52853","marks":["bold"],"text":"Global κ display:"},{"id":"spn-52854","text":" The existing HUD gains a κ readout showing the maximum κ across all SCCs in the graph, and a count of SCCs."}]}],"id":"blk-45446","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45449","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52855","marks":["bold"],"text":"Routing indicator:"},{"id":"spn-52856","text":" \"mode: RETRIEVAL\" (all κ = 0) or \"mode: DELIBERATION\" (any κ > 0)."}]}],"id":"blk-45448","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45450","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52857","text":"4.4 The [&] Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-45451","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52858","marks":["bold"],"text":"Grammar extension:"}]},{"id":"blk-45452","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"# Extended [&] capability grammar — topology-aware routing\nTopologyOp      := \"&topology\" \".\" (\"analyze\" | \"route\" | \"kappa\")\n\n# Updated pipeline pattern\nInferencePipeline :=\n    \"&memory.recall\" \"(\" QueryExpr \")\"\n    \"|>\" \"&topology.analyze\" \"()\"\n    \"|>\" \"&topology.route\" \"()\"\n    \"|>\" \"&reason.deliberate\" \"(\" \"budget:\" \":κ\" \")\"\n    \"|>\" \"&memory.learn\" \"()\""},{"id":"blk-45453","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52859","marks":["bold"],"text":"Schema extension (ampersand.schema.json):"}]},{"id":"blk-45454","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"&topology.analyze\": {\n      \"provider\": \"graphonomous\",\n      \"description\": \"Compute SCC decomposition and κ values for a subgraph\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"max_scc_size_for_exact\": 20,\n        \"approximation_strategy\": \"scc_size_proxy\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"&topology.route\": {\n      \"provider\": \"builtin\",\n      \"description\": \"Route inference based on κ: DAG regions → fast path, SCC regions → deliberation\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"deliberation_provider\": \"deliberatic\",\n        \"fast_path_provider\": \"graphonomous\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-45455","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52860","text":"4.5 TickTickClock"}]},{"id":"blk-45456","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52861","marks":["bold"],"text":"Connection:"},{"id":"spn-52862","text":" For discrete time-series dynamics, the transition graph of the system has κ > 0 if and only if the system has a periodic orbit. TickTickClock can use this as a formal periodicity detector:"}]},{"id":"blk-45457","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52863","text":"Discretize time-series data into state transitions"}]}],"id":"blk-45458","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52864","text":"Build the transition graph"}]}],"id":"blk-45460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52865","text":"Compute κ"}]}],"id":"blk-45462","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52866","text":"κ > 0 → periodic pattern detected, flag for temporal reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-45464","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52867","text":"κ = 0 → pure drift, no recurrence"}]}],"id":"blk-45466","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45468","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52868","text":"This is a secondary integration (TickTickClock already has Mamba SSM for pattern detection), but it provides a complementary structural signal."}]},{"id":"blk-45469","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52869","text":"4.6 OpenSentience"}]},{"id":"blk-45470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52870","marks":["bold"],"text":"Role:"},{"id":"spn-52871","text":" Research home for the theoretical foundations. Hosts:"}]},{"id":"blk-45471","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52872","text":"The κ paper (theoretical background, proofs, categorical framework)"}]}],"id":"blk-45472","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52873","text":"The proof code (runnable verification)"}]}],"id":"blk-45474","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52874","text":"Interactive demos (live κ computation on user-constructed graphs)"}]}],"id":"blk-45476","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45479","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52875","text":"The original Scale Topology Axis essay (broader theoretical context connecting κ to physics, cosmology, and consciousness science)"}]}],"id":"blk-45478","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45480","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52876","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45481","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52877","text":"5. Implementation Priority"}]},{"id":"blk-45482","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52878","text":"Phase 1: Core (ship first)"}]},{"id":"blk-45483","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45485","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52879","text":"[ ] Port κ computation to Elixir (Graphonomous server-side)"}]}],"id":"blk-45484","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45487","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52880","text":"[ ] Port κ computation to JavaScript (BendScript client-side)"}]}],"id":"blk-45486","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45489","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52881","text":"[ ] Integrate Tarjan's SCC into Graphonomous's graph index"}]}],"id":"blk-45488","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45491","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52882","text":"[ ] Return topology annotations from "},{"id":"spn-52883","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"}]}],"id":"blk-45490","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45493","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52884","text":"[ ] Add SCC visualization to BendScript canvas"}]}],"id":"blk-45492","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45494","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52885","text":"Phase 2: Routing (ship second)"}]},{"id":"blk-45495","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45497","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52886","text":"[ ] Implement κ router in the [&] pipeline"}]}],"id":"blk-45496","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45499","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52887","text":"[ ] Connect κ router to Deliberatic trigger"}]}],"id":"blk-45498","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45501","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52888","text":"[ ] Add deliberation budget function"}]}],"id":"blk-45500","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45503","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52889","text":"[ ] Test on real knowledge graph queries: does κ-aware routing improve answer quality?"}]}],"id":"blk-45502","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45504","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52890","text":"Phase 3: Polish (ship third)"}]},{"id":"blk-45505","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52891","text":"[ ] BendScript topology preview via context menu"}]}],"id":"blk-45506","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45509","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52892","text":"[ ] Bend/Unbend context menu actions"}]}],"id":"blk-45508","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52893","text":"[ ] HUD κ display and routing indicator"}]}],"id":"blk-45510","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52894","text":"[ ] TickTickClock periodicity detection via κ"}]}],"id":"blk-45512","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45515","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52895","text":"[ ] OpenSentience publication of κ paper and demos"}]}],"id":"blk-45514","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45516","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52896","text":"Phase 4: Optimization"}]},{"id":"blk-45517","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45519","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52897","text":"[ ] Incremental SCC maintenance (avoid full recomputation on every edge change)"}]}],"id":"blk-45518","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45521","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52898","text":"[ ] Approximate κ for large SCCs (> 20 nodes)"}]}],"id":"blk-45520","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45523","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52899","text":"[ ] Benchmark: latency impact of topology computation on query path"}]}],"id":"blk-45522","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45525","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52900","text":"[ ] A/B test: κ-routed inference vs. uniform retrieval on quality metrics"}]}],"id":"blk-45524","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45526","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52901","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45527","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52902","text":"6. Success Metrics"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-45529","spans":[{"id":"spn-52903","text":"Metric"}]},{"id":"blk-45530","spans":[{"id":"spn-52904","text":"Baseline (no κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-45531","spans":[{"id":"spn-52905","text":"Target (with κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-45532","spans":[{"id":"spn-52906","text":"How to Measure"}]}],"id":"blk-45528","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-45533","spans":[{"id":"spn-52907","text":"Answer coherence on circular topics"}]},{"id":"blk-45534","spans":[{"id":"spn-52908","text":"Human eval ~60%"}]},{"id":"blk-45535","spans":[{"id":"spn-52909","text":"Human eval ~80%"}]},{"id":"blk-45536","spans":[{"id":"spn-52910","text":"Blind eval on queries touching SCCs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45537","spans":[{"id":"spn-52911","text":"Unnecessary deliberation calls"}]},{"id":"blk-45538","spans":[{"id":"spn-52912","text":"N/A (no routing)"}]},{"id":"blk-45539","spans":[{"id":"spn-52913","text":"< 20% of queries"}]},{"id":"blk-45540","spans":[{"id":"spn-52914","text":"Track κ=0 queries that hit deliberation anyway"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45541","spans":[{"id":"spn-52915","text":"Deliberation convergence speed"}]},{"id":"blk-45542","spans":[{"id":"spn-52916","text":"Fixed rounds"}]},{"id":"blk-45543","spans":[{"id":"spn-52917","text":"κ+1 rounds avg"}]},{"id":"blk-45544","spans":[{"id":"spn-52918","text":"Measure rounds to convergence"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45545","spans":[{"id":"spn-52919","text":"User engagement in BendScript"}]},{"id":"blk-45546","spans":[{"id":"spn-52920","text":"Nodes/edges per session"}]},{"id":"blk-45547","spans":[{"id":"spn-52921","text":"+30%"}]},{"id":"blk-45548","spans":[{"id":"spn-52922","text":"Track topology actions (bend/unbend/stargate)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45549","spans":[{"id":"spn-52923","text":"OpenSentience traffic"}]},{"id":"blk-45550","spans":[{"id":"spn-52924","text":"Baseline"}]},{"id":"blk-45551","spans":[{"id":"spn-52925","text":"Organic from dev community"}]},{"id":"blk-45552","spans":[{"id":"spn-52926","text":"Track referrals from product UIs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-45553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52927","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45554","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52928","text":"7. Instrumentation Requirements (NEW in v0.2.0)"}]},{"id":"blk-45555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52929","text":"All κ computation must emit telemetry. This is required for Gate C (performance) and Gate D (product effect) validation."}]},{"id":"blk-45556","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52930","text":"7.1 Latency Counters (Elixir — "},{"id":"spn-52931","marks":["code"],"text":":telemetry"},{"id":"spn-52932","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-45557","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":"# Emit on every topology computation\n# REQUIRED UNIT: duration_ms (float milliseconds)\n# If measured via :timer.tc/1, convert with: duration_ms = duration_us / 1000.0\n:telemetry.execute(\n  [:graphonomous, :topology, :analyze],\n  %{duration_ms: elapsed_ms, node_count: n, edge_count: e},\n  %{scc_count: scc_count, max_kappa: max_kappa, routing: routing}\n)"},{"id":"blk-45558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52933","text":"Track:"}]},{"id":"blk-45559","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45561","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52934","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.duration_ms"},{"id":"spn-52935","text":" — p50, p95, p99 (canonical latency metric)"}]}],"id":"blk-45560","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52936","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.node_count"},{"id":"spn-52937","text":" — distribution of subgraph sizes"}]}],"id":"blk-45562","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52938","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.edge_count"},{"id":"spn-52939","text":" — distribution of subgraph densities"}]}],"id":"blk-45564","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52940","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.scc_count"},{"id":"spn-52941","text":" — how often SCCs are found"}]}],"id":"blk-45566","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45569","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52942","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.routing.deliberate_ratio"},{"id":"spn-52943","text":" — deliberate / total analyzes"}]}],"id":"blk-45568","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52944","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.self_loop_filtered_count"},{"id":"spn-52945","text":" — number of self-loops ignored during adjacency construction"}]}],"id":"blk-45570","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45572","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52946","text":"7.2 Routing Decision Counters"}]},{"id":"blk-45573","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":":telemetry.execute(\n  [:graphonomous, :topology, :route],\n  %{},\n  %{decision: :fast | :deliberate, max_kappa: max_kappa, trigger: :retrieve_context | :analyze_topology}\n)"},{"id":"blk-45574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52947","text":"Track:"}]},{"id":"blk-45575","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45577","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52948","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.fast_count"},{"id":"spn-52949","text":" — queries routed to fast path"}]}],"id":"blk-45576","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52950","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.deliberate_count"},{"id":"spn-52951","text":" — queries routed to deliberation"}]}],"id":"blk-45578","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52952","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.deliberate_ratio"},{"id":"spn-52953","text":" — deliberate / total (target: < 30% on typical workloads)"}]}],"id":"blk-45580","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45582","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-52954","text":"7.3 BendScript Performance (JavaScript — "},{"id":"spn-52955","marks":["code"],"text":"performance.now()"},{"id":"spn-52956","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-45583","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"const t0 = performance.now();\nconst topo = analyzeTopology(plane);\nconst elapsed = performance.now() - t0;\nconsole.debug(`[κ] topology: ${elapsed.toFixed(1)}ms, maxκ=${topo.maxKappa}, sccs=${topo.sccCount}`);"},{"id":"blk-45584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52957","text":"Target: < 50ms at 100 nodes."}]},{"id":"blk-45585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52958","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-52959","text":"*Spec version: 0.2.0. Status: Draft (normalized). Depends on: kappa_reference.py (computation), kappa_theory_applied.md (theoretical foundations). Products affected: Graphonomous, Deliberatic, BendScript, [&] Protocol, TickTickClock, OpenSentience.*"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierahmauvqclcrblslxpgi6e7ge6ezij3d6pxt2n4qlidjzw4vpo7qva","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}